Source: qcom-qcomtee
Maintainer: Abhinaba Rakshit <abhinaba.rakshit@oss.qualcomm.com>
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, git
Homepage: https://github.com/quic/quic-teec

Package: qcom-libqcomtee
Architecture: arm64
Section: libs
Description:
 QCOM‑TEE (libqcomtee) is a user-space C library that enables applications to communicate
 with Qualcomm’s Trusted Execution Environment (QTEE) via the Linux TEE subsystem using object-based IPC.
 .
 This package consists of library libqcomtee to communicate with qcomtee kernel driver.
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}

Package: qcom-libqcomtee-dev
Architecture: arm64
Section: libdevel
Description:
 QCOM‑TEE (libqcomtee) is a user-space C library that enables applications to communicate
 with Qualcomm’s Trusted Execution Environment (QTEE) via the Linux TEE subsystem using object-based IPC.
 .
 This package contains library headers for the shared libraries shipped in the
 qcom-libqcomtee package.
Depends: qcom-libqcomtee (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
